@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    ``Retrying(enabled=False)`` and ``AsyncRetrying(enabled=False)`` now run
+    the body exactly once when used with the iterator pattern
+    (``for attempt in retrying: with attempt: ...``). Exceptions propagate
+    unchanged instead of being wrapped in ``RetryError``, matching the
+    ``@retry(enabled=False)`` decorator behaviour.
